TRON2 MuJoCo simulator
Copyright (c) 2024-2026 LimX Dynamics Inc.

This product contains a Python MuJoCo-based simulator (`simulator.py`,
`tron2_sim/`) that bridges the LimX low-level SDK simulator-side API
(`RobotCmd` / `RobotState` with q / dq / tau / Kp / Kd, plus `ImuData`
and gripper `GripperCmd` / `GripperState`) to a MuJoCo `MjModel` /
`MjData` simulation of the TRON2 robot family (SF, WF, DA, DACH, and
DASF variants), so a controller can drive the simulated robot over
exactly the same wire format it uses on hardware, together with the
accompanying documentation and media.

